Subject: [PATCH 2/3] security: SECURITY.md, release checksums, installer
 verification, Dependabot

Closes the quick-win items from PRODUCTION_READINESS_PLAN.md Phase 6:

- SECURITY.md: private disclosure via GitHub advisories, 72h ack,
  14d high-severity fix SLA, explicit scope
- release.yml: every artifact now ships a sha256sum-compatible
  .sha256 file (Linux: sha256sum; Windows: Get-FileHash), attached
  to both CI artifacts and the GitHub Release
- install.sh / install.ps1: download and verify the checksum before
  extracting; warn-and-continue for pre-checksum releases so old
  tags stay installable
- .github/dependabot.yml: weekly updates for cargo, GitHub Actions,
  and both npm trees (docs, vscode-extension), minor/patch grouped
- Plan Phase 6 updated to reflect landed vs remaining items
